hetero: forced words said as written, forced first

The heteronym table consults grammar; some words need no asking. A
forced word is replaced by its annotation wherever it stands, before
the heteronym table is even consulted, so a word whose dictionary
entry cannot carry what it has to say is said from here instead.
candidate and the users produce reading go first.
Applied at build time so CI builds the same tree.
